/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k-34-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k:35:  rule <k> Subscript(OBJ:Val, I:Int) => applyIndex(OBJ, I) ... </k>
