/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k-50-  rule <k> #evalB(NoBound)  => noB ... </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k-51-  rule <k> #evalB(E:Expr)   => E ~> #toSome ... </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/subscript.k-52-  rule <k> I:Int ~> #toSome => someB(I) ... </k>
