/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-62-  // ==== dict subscript READ: d[k] (assoc lookup; KeyError is out of subset) ==
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-63-  rule applyIndexD(dictV(KS:ValSeq, VS:ValSeq), K:Val) => dGet(KS, VS, K)
