/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k:64:  // circularities anchor on #loop and narrowing substitutes the structure)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k:65:  syntax KItem ::= #loop(Val, Expr, Stmts) | #loopStep(Expr, Stmts)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k-66-                 | #while(Expr, Stmts) | #whileCond(Expr, Stmts)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/controls.k:67:                 | #loopLbl(K) | "#cont" | "#brk"
