+- `lake build`: exit 0, output hash `0e2e2d72e7c0440573e3b5c9dbb1b997179c6be5d7e5e3bbff58b63c59177e07`.
+- Obligation count: 0.
+- Target: null.
+- Generated-tree hash: `e336f07528f3cb2b9b28d797c6a1e02ed86e20b3b520073a086222b0bbcb28d4`.
